      "id": 26547,
      "name": "UXM266",
      "username": "UXM266",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/{size}/1966_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-07-23T20:46:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Follow-up Question:</p>\n<p>It pertains to the the extra power that does one hero 3 points toxic damage and gain 3 points hp.<br>\nIf I make Legacy immune to Toxic Damage, does this mean when a hero hits him he loses no life and the heroes gain 3 HP?</p>\n<p>I had this scenario once when hosting the game at a fundraiser my group was hosting. I wanted to make sure I didn’t play it wrong.</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:00:29.223Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
